{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22402","headline":"夜雨有念 · 白居易","name":"夜雨有念","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"以道治心气，终岁得晏然。\n何乃戚戚意，忽来风雨天。\n既非慕荣显，又不恤饥寒。\n胡爲悄不乐，抱膝残灯前。\n形影闇相问，心默对以言。\n骨肉能几人，各在天一端。\n吾兄寄宿州，吾弟客东川。\n南北五千里，吾身在中间。\n欲去病未能，欲住心不安。\n有如波上舟，此缚而彼牵。\n自我向道来，於今六七年。\n链成不二性，消尽千万缘。\n唯有恩爱火，往往犹熬煎。\n岂是药无効，病多难尽蠲。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22402.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22402","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}